WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,280
It's over, it's over, let's run quickly

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:09,930
There are caterpillars all down there. Wow.

3
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:29,830
Even Qu Qu Tanglang dares to provoke us

4
00:00:29,830 --> 00:00:31,190
I guess he can run fast

5
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:50,150
Is this just like scratching a sheep without eating?

6
00:00:50,910 --> 00:00:59,760
This brother is here to kill me

7
00:00:59,760 --> 00:01:31,570
Too fierce

8
00:01:31,570 --> 00:01:34,280
The four green insect spirit masters are no match for you.

9
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:36,560
Performed well

10
00:01:36,850 --> 00:01:40,620
These are open to hatred

11
00:01:40,620 --> 00:01:42,540
Do you want to give our spiritual master a few lines?

12
00:01:42,820 --> 00:01:44,370
It will definitely please him

13
00:01:44,370 --> 00:01:45,570
Make a fuss

14
00:01:45,570 --> 00:01:59,980
Can you have some ambition?

15
00:01:59,980 --> 00:02:01,740
Why have you grown up again?

16
00:02:01,740 --> 00:02:03,020
I wish I could be so fast

17
00:02:03,020 --> 00:02:05,720
The spirit master will definitely like it

18
00:02:05,720 --> 00:02:07,080
It's really hopeless
